<title>USA: Ultratech Stepper Inc Q4 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Ultratech Stepper Inc Q4 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 Mos ended 12/31    12 Mos ended 12/31</p>
<p>				   1996     1995	 1996	1995</p>
<p> Net sales		  $43,500  $47,296   $193,508  $157,831</p>
<p> Gross profit		23,794   25,229    104,893    82,288</p>
<p> Operating income	  10,998   10,466     46,678    31,782</p>
<p> Net income		   8,559    8,043     35,311    24,234</p>
<p> Net EPS			 0.40     0.38	 1.66	1.20</p>
<p> Number shrs		 21,359   21,356     21,324    20,158</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: All share and per share data retroactively restated to reflect a two-for-one stock split distributed in the form of a 100- percent dividend on May 10, 1995.</p>
<p>The Statement of Income for the year ended December 31, 1995 has been derived from the audited financial statements at that date.</p>
